OpenClaw Dashboard Extras is an independent community project. It is not an
official OpenClaw distribution and is not affiliated with the OpenClaw Foundation.

Chat Math is a math-only adaptation of Tom-Notch/openclaw-dashboard-extras
v0.3.2, commit b04a72c25111bab84461581d8a58e1ef974ae8e4.
Upstream: https://github.com/Tom-Notch/openclaw-dashboard-extras
The upstream math scanner, KaTeX/MathML sanitizer and native transcript DOM
adapter are adapted here; upstream file actions are deliberately not included.

Some math parsing and native-file safety code derives from the MIT-licensed
openclaw-dashboard-compat project and OpenClaw-related contributions.
